# Local xhs Execution

In this repository, always run the CLI from source with `uv run xhs ...`.

- Prefer `uv run xhs ...` over bare `xhs ...`
- Do not suggest `uv tool install xiaohongshu-cli` or `uv tool upgrade xiaohongshu-cli` unless the user explicitly wants to test the published package
- For authentication checks, use `uv run xhs status`
- For login flows, use `uv run xhs login`
- For local development commands, prefer `uv run pytest ...` and `uv run ruff check .`
